<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Yellow 1997 EPS view up.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Yellow 1997 EPS view up.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Gruntal &amp; Co said Friday it increased its 1997 full-year earnings per share estimate on Yellow Corp to $1.20 from $1.15 after the company reported $0.23 per share first-quarter earnings -- in line with Gruntal's $0.25 per share top-of-the-range expectation.</p>
<p>--Analyst Steve Lewins in a report also retained an outperform (speculative) rating on the freight carrier.</p>
<p>--Yellow was off 5/8 at 20.</p>
<p>	  ((Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
